<div class="language-csharp line-numbers-mode" data-highlighter="prismjs" data-ext="cs"><pre v-pre><code class="language-csharp"><span class="line"><span class="token comment">// src/Croupier.Sdk/Models/ClientConfig.cs</span></span>
